        "id": 203560,
        "name": "Chaosmancer",
        "username": "Chaosmancer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/chaosmancer/{size}/1977_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-13T19:47:44.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I listen to all the spoilers, much like MindWanderer I'm going to be a GM for these games more often than not, meaning I'll be reading the book cover to cover and the adventures cover to cover. Any spoilers will then be revealed to me... and why wait? It's no more impactful to hear now than to read by myself a few months or a year from now.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Plus, some of the spoiled stuff then gets talked about on here, and I like talking things over with other fans so I don't want to miss out on that.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for Interludes, I listen to all of them. I don't download anything if that makes a difference, I just go to the Letters Page webpage and listen to every episode and Interlude using the built in player.&nbsp;</p>",
