        "id": 203561,
        "name": "Blackfang108",
        "username": "Blackfang108",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/74df32/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-13T20:25:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've listen to all the episodes (OK, I haven't figured out how to get ALL the episodes, but the ones that have been released, I've listened to.)</p><p>I skip nothing, and honestly don't understand how anything could be spoilers, at this juncture, minus maybe some OblivAeon things.&nbsp; And that's a big maybe.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: especially as, as far as i've come to understand, giving out all of this information is the POINT of the podcast.</p>",
