        "id": 203562,
        "name": "speedyolrac",
        "username": "speedyolrac",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/speedyolrac/{size}/1918_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-13T21:15:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You are asking the wrong group, Most people on this forums are die hard Sentinels fans. Most of us will gooble any show you guys make. Need to ask elsewhere or even on the podcast it self.</p><p>Rebranding the Interludes may be the way to go. Most other podcast 2nd shows are horrible, so i skip them. Got to raise the awareness. I am also relistening to the whole show and your content has improved. As well as your interludes. I miss the hour long shows. Now we got 2 hours of hearing you guys talk, Adam quiting, food talks and faking people's death (Still waiting on the \"Just kidding NightMist is alive\" T_T), Makes Bingo so much easier.</p><p>I never mind spoiler because I can forget them if need be or Like to talk to them with my discord buddies.</p><p>I can also say with the upmost confidance that the La Captian/Comodora is/was/willbe my favorite episode so far right behind NightMIst. When you guys &nbsp;are trying to make time travel make sense will be great. Deffently am waiting to listen to it. (and your food podcast, so inspired). I mean Prime/Eternal/Extreme/Iron Legacy's Haka can both exsist and not exisist in the same time right.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
