        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dprcooke/{size}/1961_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-09-14T00:44:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'm with pretty much everyone on here. &nbsp;I listen to every single episode (multiple times!), including the interludes. Also, I LOVE the spoilers.</p><p>Just wondering something about your download numbers: do those include people who listen via iTunes/Android podcast subscriptions? &nbsp;Or are your numbers just direct downloads from the Letters Page website? &nbsp;Not sure if that would make a difference? &nbsp;(I download everything from the site, for the record).</p>",
